Strategy for Version 4
● Use dependency parser to recognize contexts where mutations should occur ● Generate synthetic training examples by varying mutations in context ● Nuair nach mbíonn an bean ildánach seo… ● For version 3, the label on this example would indicate just the mutation (“S”) ● Explainability: “enrich” this tag set to include reference to a standard grammar ● Example above would be tagged “S/10.2.1.a”

